  "text": "FAMILY WORKSPACE\nCare\nCaregivers\nMessages\nRequest care\nMB\nMaria Bennett\nFamily\n\nREQUEST CARE\n\nWhat kind of care would help?\n\nChoose one visit or a regular schedule. The same details and safeguards stay with your care from request through payment.\n\nBEFORE PUBLISHING\n\nAll essentials are ready. Review once, then publish.\n\nPERSON\n\nReady\n\nMaria Bennett\n\nHELP\n\nReady\n\nCompanionship\n\nTIME\n\nReady\n\nSep 14, 2026 at 10:00 AM for 02:00 (2 hours)\n\nADDRESS\n\nReady\n\nRaleigh, NC 27601\n\nSAVE TIME\n\nReuse saved information, then adjust today's date and time.\n\nUse last request\nUse saved details\nChoose a care pattern\n\nStart here. This choice changes the schedule questions below, not how the rest of your care works.\n\n✓\nOne visit\nCare on one specific date and time.\n✓\nRecurring care\nA repeating weekly schedule with a familiar caregiver.\nWho and what\n\nStart with the person receiving care and the help they need.\n\nWho is receiving care?\n\nMe\nA family member\n\nUse a saved care profile (optional)\n\nChoose the person once and we will share the same caregiver preview with this request.\n\nEllie\nMother · Reviewed Sep 7, 2026\n\nCare recipient: Maria Bennett\n\nThis request will be marked as care for the person posting it.\n\nHelp needed\n\n✓\nCompanionship\n✓\nDaily living assistance\n✓\nErrands\n✓\nLight housekeeping\n✓\nMeal preparation\n✓\nMedication reminders\n✓\nTransportation\n\nMore details if you want\n\nSkip this unless it helps the caregiver arrive prepared.\n\nOptional\nVisit schedule\n\nAdd only the dates and times that apply to the care pattern you chose.\n\nStarting day\nStarting time\nDuration (HH:MM)\n01:00 (1 hour)\n01:30 (1h 30m)\n02:00 (2 hours)\n02:30 (2h 30m)\n03:00 (3 hours)\n03:30 (3h 30m)\n04:00 (4 hours)\n04:30 (4h 30m)\n05:00 (5 hours)\n05:30 (5h 30m)\n06:00 (6 hours)\n06:30 (6h 30m)\n07:00 (7 hours)\n07:30 (7h 30m)\n08:00 (8 hours)\n08:30 (8h 30m)\n09:00 (9 hours)\n09:30 (9h 30m)\n10:00 (10 hours)\n10:30 (10h 30m)\n11:00 (11 hours)\n11:30 (11h 30m)\n12:00 (12 hours)\nSchedule: Sep 14, 2026 at 10:00 AM for 02:00 (2 hours)\nWhere\n\nCaregivers see the area before applying. Exact details stay with the request.\n\nStreet address\nApartment, unit, or gate (optional)\nCity\nState\nAlabama\nArizona\nArkansas\nCalifornia\nColorado\nConnecticut\nDelaware\nFlorida\nGeorgia\nIdaho\nIllinois\nIndiana\nIowa\nKansas\nKentucky\nLouisiana\nMaine\nMaryland\nMassachusetts\nMichigan\nMinnesota\nMississippi\nMissouri\nMontana\nNebraska\nNevada\nNew Hampshire\nNew Jersey\nNew Mexico\nNew York\nNorth Carolina\nNorth Dakota\nOhio\nOklahoma\nOregon\nPennsylvania\nRhode Island\nSouth Carolina\nSouth Dakota\nTennessee\nTexas\nUtah\nVermont\nVirginia\nWashington\nWest Virginia\nWisconsin\nWyoming\nDistrict of Columbia\nZIP\nReview and publish\n\nCheck the essentials before caregivers see the request.\n\nMake this request private\nThis request won’t appear in the caregiver marketplace. Only caregivers you invite can view and respond to it. You’ll choose invitees after creating the request.\n\nFOR\n\nMaria Bennett\n\nSelf\n\nHELP\n\nCompanionship\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nSep 14, 2026 at 10:00 AM for 02:00 (2 hours)\n\nADDRESS\n\n210 Oakwood Avenue\n\nRaleigh, NC 27601\n\nESTIMATED ONE-TIME COST\n\nCare · 2.00h × $30.00/hr*\n$60.00\nProcessing fee · $1.00/hr\n$2.00\n\nESTIMATED TOTAL\n\n$62.00\n\n*A $1.00/hour processing fee is added to the $30.00/hour care rate.\n\nCancel\nCreate private request\n\n© 2026 LoLo Care Inc\n\n﻿\nTerms of Service\nPrivacy Policy\nPayments & Cancellation\nCaregiver Terms\nFamily Terms\nSafety Policy\nAll Legal Documents\nSupport",
